  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The grab mode in open beta 2022.2.2p3 adds a smoothing factor to personal mirror placement that feels VERY sluggish. Whether it's picking it up from being stationary or just rotating it, it feels a lot less reactive than it did in the previous version. While I understand the smoothing factor may help with vertigo, I think there should either be:\na) An option to toggle off smoothing.\nb) A reduction in the smoothing so it doesn't take so damn long to reposition.",
